      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> You feel like you’ve ended up at the centre of a swarm of angry bees as fragments and shot whistle past you. You flinch as one piece makes a small cut near your neck and other spent fragments pelt your chest.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> You gain @Condition[Blinded] (1) as you duck your head and raise an arm, shield or other object to protect your face. You feel like a wuss!</p>"
